<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/18/eng@/~part_II__chp_3__cl_12__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "If the Chairperson referred to in paragraph (1)(a) presiding over any proceedings in respect of a complaint of sexual harassment dies or becomes incapacitated, or is for any other reason unable to complete or dispose of the proceedings, the complaint of sexual harassment shall be heard and continued and presided over by any other Chairperson as determined by the President."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/18/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/18/eng@/~part_II__chp_3__cl_12__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/18/eng@/~part_II__chp_3__cl_12> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/18/eng@> .
