<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/18/eng@/~part_II__chp_3__cl_12__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "If any of the members of the Tribunal referred to in paragraph (1)(b) in respect of a complaint of sexual harassment dies or becomes incapacitated, or is for any other reason unable to complete or dispose of the proceedings, the President shall appoint any other member of the Tribunal to the panel to continue the proceedings."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/18/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/18/eng@/~part_II__chp_3__cl_12__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/18/eng@/~part_II__chp_3__cl_12> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/18/eng@> .
