<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/18/eng@/~part_II__chp_3__cl_16__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Tribunal may, as regards to every complaint of sexual harassment within its jurisdiction and with agreement of the parties, assess whether, in all the circumstances, it is appropriate for the Tribunal to assist the parties to negotiate an agreed settlement in relation to the complaint of sexual harassment."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/18/eng@> .
